Output demo-simple.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Shell "bash"
Set TypingSpeed 100ms

Type "# Jerry's Gym - gymctl Demo"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "./gymctl --help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "./gymctl list | head -10"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms